From: "Claude (fill agent)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 22:54:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] NDNormalForm: the forward transfer and the ledger

The normal form's
constant nf_C k = 6(2k+4) + k(2(2k+4)+12) + 21 + 15k, the host machine over the
verifier, the ledger (the host's budget 0 + 2|s| + TQ + 11 is at most
nf_C k (t + 1) for every t at least the first halting time), and the forward
transfer: an accepting branch of N within t steps, cut at its first halting
time, has its display accepted by the verifier, so the host accepts within
exactly nf_C k (t + 1) choices.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
